  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Kotak Royale Signature Credit Card is a rewards card primarily designed to offer benefits on travel-related spends. The card offers2X rewards (4 points per Rs. 150 spent) on hotels, airlines & air carriers, restaurants, travel agencies, tour operators (including package tour operators), and international spends. Besides this, it offers a base reward rate of 2 points per Rs. 150 spent on other categories. While this card offers accelerated rewards on the travel category, the overall reward rate is relatively low at 0.66% on select categories and 0.33% on other spends, primarily due to its low reward redemption value of 1 Reward Point = Up to Rs. 0.25. Besides rewards, the card offers complimentary domestic lounge visits and other basic benefits such as railway and fuel surcharge waivers. Cardholders can also earn up to 30,000 reward points as milestone benefits on spending Rs. 8 Lakh in a year. With a moderate annual fee and an easily achievable annual fee waiver condition, this card is a suitable option for consumers looking to save on their travel spends. Note: Kotak Mahindra Bank has discontinued the issuance of this card for new customers. The features and benefits available on this page apply only to the existing credit cardholders.__",
